 //
 // Parameters:
 //   streamId - The stream ID
 //   sock - The socket
 //   saved_errno - The errno
 //
 // Returns:
 //   -1 = hard error
 //   0  = a soft error (ICMP_UNREACHABLE) the far-end may be delayed by signaling
 //
 // Note:
 //  In ipg5/ipg6 phones where wifi is prevalent, MS frequently receives an
